 ### Combat quick reference
 
+- **Encounter:** clear all connected Noise (including Technical Corridors if connected), draw a bag token, place its matching Intruder, compare its number to all cards in the triggering hand (including Contamination): fewer means Surprise Attack. **Keep the drawn non-Blank token aside outside the bag** until a rule returns it, such as an Intruder hiding in Technical Corridors. A Blank instead restores connected Noise and returns to the bag.
 - **Shoot (1):** pick Weapon + target, discard 1 Ammo, roll Combat die; on a hit, add Injury marker(s), then draw an Intruder Attack card and check the Injury Effect (blood icon vs. Injury markers).
 - **Melee (1):** draw 1 Contamination card onto your Action discard pile, pick a target in your Room, roll (2 Hits count as 1); on a miss you take 1 Serious Wound. Egg Melee never draws Contamination and a miss causes no Wound.
 - **Escape (special Move, 1):** choose a neighboring Room; resolve 1 Intruder Attack per Intruder present; survive → move (explore/Noise roll as usual); die → Corpse stays behind.
